---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Domain Success Stories | Premium Domain for Sale | Desert Rich"
  description="Case studies of premium lifestyle domains that became recognizable brands — lessons for buyers evaluating LaPlayaEsVida.com for sale."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="pt-28 pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="section-kicker mb-3">Case studies</p>
      <h1 class="heading-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-[var(--text)] mb-4">When the right domain becomes the brand</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-8">
        End users who secure culturally resonant domains often report faster trust, cleaner campaigns, and stronger type-in traffic than invented brand strings.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-base text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-10">
        <section class="surface-card rounded-3xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)] mb-2">Coastal real estate portal</h2>
          <p>
            A Latin American developer acquired a Spanish lifestyle phrase domain and reported immediate brand recognition with brokers and high-net-worth buyers — reducing paid acquisition spend on awareness.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="surface-card rounded-3xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)] mb-2">Boutique hospitality group</h2>
          <p>
            A resort collection rebranded onto an exact emotional phrase .com. Direct bookings improved as guests remembered the URL after verbal recommendations — a classic premium domain outcome.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="surface-card rounded-3xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)] mb-2">What this means for LaPlayaEsVida.com</h2>
          <p>
            “The Beach Is Life” is already a philosophy people say out loud. Owning the .com turns that phrase into durable brand equity across travel, real estate, fashion, and media.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <a href="/" class="btn-primary inline-flex" data-cta="stories-home">View LaPlayaEsVida.com listing</a>
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-8">
        <a href="/guides/" class="underline underline-offset-4">All guides</a>
        <a href="/guides/domain-valuation/" class="underline underline-offset-4">Valuation guide</a>
        <a href="/guides/beach-lifestyle-market/" class="underline underline-offset-4">Market trends</a>
      </nav>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
